{"slug":"Universal-Script-Acrylix-or-A-Cheat-for-Sans-Multiversal-Battles-2-4074","_id":"62cca0e85c6b74312cef3cea","title":"Acrylix | A Cheat for Sans Multiversal Battles 2","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":0},"features":"A semi-universal script specifically made for Sans Multiversal Battles 2 by flygeil. This script is owned by tomfooler#9999.\nNote that the features that are marked as \"UNIVERSAL\" are not expected to work in every game to exist. It may work on some, and may not on others.\n\nIt contains several features, such as:\n-(PATCHED) Spam Tool: Takes all the players' attacks and uses them at once, the aim is based on your mouse cursor's position. --Universal\n-(PATCHED) Take All Attacks: Steals everyone's attacks and gives it to you, slightly similar to Spam Tool. --Universal\n-Universe Viewer: Joins places/events the game has connections to. --Universal\n-Invisible: Makes your whole character invisible and cannot be seen.\n-God Mode: Makes your character have an endless amount of health; making you hard to kill.\n-Hide Nickname: Removes your name, even harder for people to find out you're near them.\n-Click Teleport Tool: When used, your character gets teleported into the given mouse cursor's position.\n-VR Troll: Simple script for trolling. Makes your character look like as if you're a virtual reality user.\nHere's a short video introducing Acrylix: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1cnQmONr3Jo\n\nMade by tomfooler#9999 (me) who made the UI, Spam Tool and Get All Attacks with some additional help from Nugmare#2641 and halloweengaster#2824 for helping me with coding and adding some features, 3dsonsuce01 for promoting the script, MELTINGBONES412 for testing and samuel; for the invisible script (probably god mode too)","tags":["sans multiversal b